			"notes": "Added new animations for holding a spear (Closes [#905](https://github.com/tom5454/CustomPlayerModels/issues/905))  \nUpdated Simplified Chinese Translations ([#887](https://github.com/tom5454/CustomPlayerModels/issues/887), [#930](https://github.com/tom5454/CustomPlayerModels/issues/930), [#975](https://github.com/tom5454/CustomPlayerModels/issues/975))  \nNew CPM plugin registration on Forge and NeoForge  \nNew paper plugin with Folia support (Closes [#842](https://github.com/tom5454/CustomPlayerModels/issues/842))  \n26.2 snapshot 8 port  \n  \nFixed crash with Real Camera 0.7.0 (Closes [#881](https://github.com/tom5454/CustomPlayerModels/issues/881))  \nRe-added Real Camera compat on 1.21.8 and 26.1  \nRe-added Vivecraft support on 1.21.11+  \nFixed duplicated chat messages on babric b1.7.3 servers (Closes [#969](https://github.com/tom5454/CustomPlayerModels/issues/969))  \nFixed gesture gui crashing on babric b1.7.3 when playing on a server (Closes [#968](https://github.com/tom5454/CustomPlayerModels/issues/968))  \nFixed texture editor not working on 1.21.8+ (Closes [#917](https://github.com/tom5454/CustomPlayerModels/issues/917))  \nFixed editor issue with ImmediatelyFast (Closes [#821](https://github.com/tom5454/CustomPlayerModels/issues/821))  \nFixed incorrect resource reloader usage (Closes [#970](https://github.com/tom5454/CustomPlayerModels/issues/970))  \nFixed animations breaking in the Inventory Screen (Closes [#965](https://github.com/tom5454/CustomPlayerModels/issues/965))"
